msgid "Plot the samplex DAG and hover over the nodes to see the following:\n"
msgstr "Plot DAG samplex dan arahkan kursor ke node untuk melihat hal berikut:\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Bullet: '*   '
#, no-wrap
msgid "All of the sampling nodes (stars) are responsible for generating randomizations for twirling, sampling from noise models, or injecting basis changes.\n"
msgstr "Semua node sampling (bintang) bertugas menghasilkan pengacakan untuk twirling, mengambil sampel dari model noise, atau menyuntikkan basis change.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Bullet: '*   '
#, no-wrap
msgid "All of the collection nodes (bow ties) are responsible for rendering output slices, which are measurement flips or parameter angles.\n"
msgstr "Semua node collection (dasi kupu-kupu) bertugas merender slice output, yaitu bit flip pengukuran atau sudut parameter.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Bullet: '*   '
#, no-wrap
